# =============================================================================
# .gitignore
#
# NOTE: git requires FORWARD slashes. The previous version used backslashes
# ("cfs_preprocessed\"), which git treats as an escape rather than a path
# separator - which is why 730 files under cfs_preprocessed/ ended up tracked
# despite appearing to be ignored.
# =============================================================================

# ── Bulk datasets ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Re-downloadable from PhysioNet / NSRR; ~2 GB and not meaningful in diffs.
data/
cfs_preprocessed/
csv-docs/
unsorted/
sleep-edf-database-expanded-1.0.0/
processed_sleepedf/tensors/
processed_sleepedf/spectral/

# ── Raw recordings and archives ──────────────────────────────────────────────
*.edf
*.rec
*.zip
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.7z

# ── Large model binaries ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.pth
*.onnx
*.h5
*.ckpt
*.safetensors

# Senior's checkpoints (large, regenerable by re-running their notebooks)
/results/**/*.pt

# Resume-only checkpoints: redundant with the matching *_best.pt
*_last.pt

# ...but DO keep the trained models this project delivers.
!distillation/results/**/teacher_best.pt
!distillation/results/**/student_best.pt

# ── Regenerable intermediate caches ──────────────────────────────────────────
# Cached per-recording predictions and teacher soft targets. Rebuilt in minutes
# by evaluate_student.py / eval_final.py / cache_teacher_logits.py.
distillation/results/probs_*/
distillation/results/preds_*/
distillation/results/teacher_preds/
distillation/results/teacher_logits_*/

# ── Python ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.venv/
venv/
env/
.pytest_cache/

# ── OS / editor ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp

# ── Secrets ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# A hardcoded Groq key was found in a notebook during this repo's setup.
# Keep credentials in environment variables, never in tracked files.
.env
.env.*
*.key
*.pem
secrets.json
credentials.json

# =============================================================================
# Deliberately NOT ignored - these are project deliverables:
#   ABSTRACT.md  PROJECT_REPORT.md  README_V2.md  CODEBASE_AUDIT.md  update.md
#   distillation/            full pipeline source
#   distillation/results/*.json      evidence artefacts
#   distillation/figures/            report figures
#   processed_sleepedf/index.csv     small, required to load the dataset
# =============================================================================

# multi-channel tensors (~8 GB, regenerate with preprocess_multichannel.py)
processed_sleepedf_mc/tensors/

# Per-recording-normalised dataset (roadmap A1, ~3.9 GB on disk).
#
# The existing `processed_sleepedf/tensors/` rule contains a slash, so git
# anchors it to the repo root and it does NOT match the copy nested under
# processed_sleepedf_pernorm/. That left 1.1 GB reachable by `git add .`.
# Fully regenerable: python distillation/make_pernorm_dataset.py
# index.csv and PERNORM_MANIFEST.json are kept - small, and the manifest
# records the three flagged recordings PROJECT_REPORT.md 6i cites.
processed_sleepedf_pernorm/**/tensors/
processed_sleepedf_pernorm/**/spectral/
processed_sleepedf_pernorm/**/*.zip
